  {
    "code": "octgn:526faef8-5db5-48ab-ab22-109916e9fda7",
    "octgnid": "526faef8-5db5-48ab-ab22-109916e9fda7",
    "name": "Murder at the Prancing Pony",
    "type_code": "rules",
    "sphere_code": "encounter",
    "traits": "",
    "text": "The Investigation Deck\nBegin the game by following the Setup instructions on stage 1A. When the players are instructed to \"build the Investigation deck,\" do the following: Take the 4 remaining Suspect enemies and the 4 remaining Hideout locations, plus each copy of Taken by Surprise, and shuffle them together without looking at them. This is the Investigation deck.\nThe players are not allowed to look at cards in the Investigation deck except when resolving the Investigate keyword or instructed by a card effect.\nThe Investigation List\nThe Investigation List on page 5 of the rules has the name of all 5 Suspect enemies and all 5 Hideout locations. During the game, players should check enemies and locations off of their Investigation list in order to help them determine the correct Suspect and Hideout by process of elimination.",
    "is_unique": false,
    "pack_code": "MatPP",
    "pack_name": "Murder at the Prancing Pony",
    "position": 999,
    "quantity": 0,
    "encounter_set": "Murder at the Prancing Pony",
    "back_name": "Murder at the Prancing Pony",
    "back_text": "Investigate X\nInvestigate is a new keyword that represents the heroes' efforts to solve the crime. When an active location with the Investigate keyword is explored, the first player shuffles the Investigation deck and looks at the top X cards. Then, he places those cards back on top of the Investigation deck in the same order.\nWhile the players are at stage 2B, the Investigate keyword on the active location is resolved before the second Forced effect on that stage.\nImmune to Player Card Effects\nCards with the text \"Immune to player card effects\" ignore the effects of all player cards. Additionally, cards that are immune to player card effects cannot be chosen as targets of player card effects.",
    "back_type_code": "rules",
    "back_imagesrc": "/cards/526faef8-5db5-48ab-ab22-109916e9fda7.B.jpg",
    "printed_stats": {},
    "imagesrc": "/cards/526faef8-5db5-48ab-ab22-109916e9fda7.jpg",
    "packs": [
      {
        "pack_code": "MatPP",
        "pack_name": "Murder at the Prancing Pony",
        "position": 999,
        "quantity": 0,
        "octgnid": "526faef8-5db5-48ab-ab22-109916e9fda7",
        "imagesrc": "https://dragncards-lotrlcg.s3.amazonaws.com/cards/English/526faef8-5db5-48ab-ab22-109916e9fda7.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "source": "dragncards",
    "source_url": "https://dragncards.com/plugin/1",
    "official": true,
    "nightmare": false
  },
