    "back_text": "The Investigation List\nSuspects: Todd the Troll, Susie the Spider, Wolf-pelt Jake, Johnny Goblin-fingers, Old Orc-eyes.\nHideouts: Bill Ferny's House, Staddle Hiding Hole, Combe Storehouse, Archet Trading Post, Chetwood Campsite.",
